==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features {{p|Shaymin}} in its {{form|Shaymin|Sky Forme}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Shining Legends|Shaymin|7}} from the {{TCG|Shining Legends}} expansion.
*{{DL|Skill (Shuffle)|Flap}} is a {{OBP|skill|Shuffle}} in [[Pokémon Shuffle]], though {{p|Shaymin}} cannot have it.
**As an attack in the TCG, it first appeared on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Starly|75}} from {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shining Pearl}}.

